9. Remove While Iterating (Tricky 🔥)
  ❌ Wrong
  for (String s : set) {
      set.remove(s); // ConcurrentModificationException
  }
  
  ✔ Correct
  Iterator<String> itr = set.iterator();
  while (itr.hasNext()) {
      itr.next();
      itr.remove();
  }

