20. Common Tricky Interview Questions
Q1. Why TreeSet doesn’t allow null?

Because it uses comparison (NPE risk)

Q2. What happens if hashCode is same but equals is false?
Stored in same bucket but treated as different objects

Q3. Which Set is fastest?
HashSet

Q4. When to use LinkedHashSet?
When order + uniqueness is required

Q5. How to remove duplicates from List?
List<String> list = List.of("A", "B", "A");
Set<String> set = new HashSet<>(list);

